      "designator": "CS23-0",
      "grouping_at_time": "Subpart F \u2014 Equipment",
      "title_at_revision": "Pressurisation and pneumatic systems",
      "text": "(a) Pressurisation system elements must be burst pressure tested to 2\u00b70 times, and proof pressure tested to 1\u00b75 times, the maximum normal operating pressure. (b) Pneumatic system elements must be burst pressure tested to 3\u00b70 times, and proof pressure tested to 1\u00b75 times, the maximum normal operating pressure. (c) An analysis, or a combination of analysis and test, may be substituted for any test required by sub-paragraph (a) or (b) if the Agency finds it equivalent to the required test.",
